a-46e5-41d7-ae02-4c29807444cd|title", "text": "Intonācija, uzmundrinot kādu"}, {"key": "8eff1cd8-30d2-4642-8620-e3c773844b49|title", "text": "Intonācija darba intervijas atbildē"}, {"key": "d4385917-56a1-490b-948e-bd283e843c90|title", "text": "Intonācija ar pretstata marķieriem (however, but)"}, {"key": "878fdbcc-2f37-412d-b9d9-075d32743661|title", "text": "Intonācija, lūdzot atļauju"}, {"key": "068d5b93-dc4b-4a89-a9d5-60c47c5cbea9|title", "text": "Intonācija, maigi sniedzot sliktas ziņas"}, {"key": "53c4ffdc-587f-4bd8-942a-4a63fbe4f359|title", "text": "Intonācija vienaldzības izteikšanā"}, {"key": "18dea0d2-ba76-4017-ad60-ca81283aec2a|title", "text": "Intonācija, nolasot cenas un daudzumus"}, {"key": "b8576abe-71c0-4a0a-a6a2-13292f96d2c8|title", "text": "Intonācija, saucot kādu pāri telpai"}, {"key": "0712e0c6-7a0d-4211-9fb0-b7ef426cd144|title", "text": "Intonācija atskaitē"}, {"key": "e0ffa6ca-f263-451e-adb5-876a4936c49e|title", "text": "Nobeiguma jauktais pārskats: izvēlieties pareizo modeli"}, {"key": "4a1e712b-60c7-4a1a-ba46-bb7dd890b366|title", "text": "Ikdienas redukcijas"}, {"key": "b8706c44-5a49-402e-9382-f18427f2084c|title", "text": "kinda, sorta, lemme, gimme"}, {"key": "1fe69396-9206-4baf-a8e5-ffcf1b604754|title", "text": "hafta, needa, useta"}, {"key": "9b9c6914-86f0-4448-91ad-32332b1c44bd|title", "text": "coulda, woulda, shoulda"}, {"key": "93381b1d-c960-4403-9a28-d6c4d2a93b75|title", "text": "dunno, dontcha, whatcha"}, {"key": "7b1c6a89-bdad-45bd-9a41-802609c8f2ff|title", "text": "outta, offa, cuppa"}, {"key": "beaa82ee-d675-44b8-adf8-596c8ca37c5a|title", "text": "c'mon, gonna be, s'more"}, {"key": "96d3b17b-36da-4b59-a18b-5199dc78c582|title", "text": "Redukcijas neformālos jautājumos"}, {"key": "aef0d49a-5252-4ae2-bca1-9a54870c0117|title", "text": "Redukcijas ar skaitļiem un laiku"}, {"key": "294bc66f-885f-487c-a434-e3f668c306c5|title", "text": "probably, trying to, supposed to"}, {"key": "5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|title", "text": "let's, gimme that, y'all"}, {"key": "1015f614-a8a6-4634-97e1-86252ed3b149|title", "text": "Neformāli skaitļi ātrā runā"}, {"key": "69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|title", "text": "Vārdi, kas neformālā runā zaudē vienu zilbi"}, {"key": "d19575cd-6d8a-4493-b1e0-f3d272543988|title", "text": "I'ma un citas ultra neformālas formas"}, {"key": "551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|title", "text": "Vēl citas neformālas sveicienu redukcijas"}, {"key": "b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|title", "text": "oughta, don't hafta, wantcha"}, {"key": "a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|title", "text": "Slavena ekstrēma redukcija: 'Did you eat yet?'"}, {"key": "e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|title", "text": "'because of' un 'sort of a'"}, {"key": "d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|title", "text": "Neformāls jā/nē: yep, nope, uh-huh"}, {"key": "d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|title", "text": "'want a' (lieta) pret 'want to' (darbība)"}, {"key": "6c1b9c14-fcf8-463c-9ba2-34b43d55e77f|title", "text": "wouldn't have → wouldn'ta"}, {"key": "2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|title", "text": "just 'cause, gonna need"}, {"key": "233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|title", "text": "ain't — am not, is not, are not"}, {"key": "dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|title", "text": "gotcha — got you"}, {"key": "83e44703-96d2-48c4-8303-0bc0b0bbb6ed|title", "text": "musta, mighta — must have, might have"}, {"key": "ae8c9220-fd86-4c54-a3d7-97ceb131af9a|title", "text": "shouldn'ta, couldn'ta — noliegti pagātnes modālie darbības vārdi"}, {"key": "7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|title", "text": "g izlaišana: doin', goin', talkin'"}, {"key": "0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|title", "text": "somethin', nothin', anythin'"}, {"key": "cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|title", "text": "'em — them"}, {"key": "66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|title", "text": "'n' — and"}, {"key": "74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|title", "text": "patstāvīgs 'cause — because"}, {"key": "f8740e37-88d7-4e64-a74d-762766ff4593|title", "text": "'course — of course"}, {"key": "a1c62d96-731e-4d96-803e-33f2cd732fc7|title", "text": "aight — all right"}, {"key": "fd275dbf-ca1f-489e-93aa-a7928df2aa76|title", "text": "letcha — let you"}, {"key": "9bf1b2d8-c97b-4451-8371-0efb3b24ecd0|title", "text": "jever — did you ever"}, {"key": "82a1afdf-f024-41d9-bb83-15d15e39a5cf|title", "text": "gonna hafta — going to have to"}, {"key": "d7d2b06f-c8dd-444a-ba6e-638346e18810|title", "text": "not gonna, wasn't gonna"}, {"key": "b0c3028d-02d0-4b69-b6b0-310ed3468566|title", "text": "innit — isn't it (britu)"}, {"key": "ddb8cc83-dc22-4690-8bab-748461e813e9|title", "text": "whaddya say — what do you say"}, {"key": "16f619b1-adfc-405e-a120-14925cf94795|title", "text": "y'know — you know (aizpildītājs)"}, {"key": "3b8f4cc8-03e2-4857-8f5b-1fdccc205c54|title", "text": "s'up — what's up"}, {"key": "6f674595-f4b4-44fa-9edf-d597d0a2e73a|title", "text": "tell 'im, ask 'er — him, her"}, {"key": "066faaed-c7b6-44d1-8bd5-0c29a8119dcb|title", "text": "kinda sorta — apvienots mīkstinātājs"}, {"key": "5bee9ab9-fa4b-4174-b055-5e0daa1d4a08|title", "text": "dincha — didn't you"}, {"key": "b787eef9-022a-4553-a472-0e4e7077c0e4|title", "text": "hadta — had to"}, {"key": "0ea50af7-f1be-4ee5-90c9-acf52cfb6dbf|title", "text": "willcha — will you"}, {"key": "8eb2f2ac-a4c2-41e6-bc12-9cf7f4a95bc1|title", "text": "lotsa, buncha — lots of, bunch of"}, {"key": "643d42f4-55c6-49bb-ba59-6641d41b118a|title", "text": "helluva — hell of a"}, {"key": "d91f71d3-f31d-4215-8d05-8e8a07483832|title", "text": "howdy — how do you do"}, {"key": "47538641-f573-4840-af35-02857a1d24de|title", "text": "s'pose — I suppose"}, {"key": "37887219-2d18-4d42-a4ac-8cc5c1ade629|title", "text": "Angļu valoda ir uzsvaru ritma valoda"}, {"key": "23da4a75-6c02-4c85-a80b-20d40101f380|title", "text": "Ritms reālā sarunā"}, {"key": "58744205-18fb-498e-9b21-9e4389c8e462|title", "text": "Skaitīt taktis, nevis zilbes"}, {"key": "2837473b-9805-